## How people install

This is a local open-source app. The user sends the repo to their own agent. The agent follows AGENTS.md and `pnpm --filter @agentphone/api setup`. stdout is one JSON object. The user only says ok, supplies Twilio credentials, or does something the agent cannot do. One US number does calls and SMS. SMS is stored on the same contact thread.

## Connect link

Optional when the server is already running. Credentials are never embedded in the human page.
